This data is from Yasuda et al, Cell Host Microbe 2015

https://www.cell.com/cell-host-microbe/pdfExtended/S1931-3128(15)00035-9

To construct this phyloseq object, OTU table was downloaded from huttenhower.sph.harvard.edu/biogeography2015.
Since this table was relative abundances, OTUs were forced to 1,000,000 read per sample and rounded.

To load this phyloseq object:
monkey<-readRDS(file = "~/Micro336-master/Assessment/Dataset-Macaque/monkey.rds")
